1
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:42,480
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,650 --> 00:00:47,500
[Episode 18 Miss Xie's Achilles]

3
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,800
Sounds good,

4
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,400
but 10 percent

5
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,039
of the storefronts...

6
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,280
Ms Xie,

7
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,240
are you trying to brush me off?

8
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,120
Exactly.

9
00:01:17,440 --> 00:01:20,400
Our name alone is worth more than that.

10
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:29,120
So, Ms Wan, what would you consider fair?

11
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,400
I think...

12
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:35,080
I'll take 30 percent of the storefronts.

13
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:37,400
And I'll waive the management fee.

14
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:40,400
Security and logistics
will be handled by my people.

15
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:43,920
As for the rates,
we'll go with the market's highest.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,160
Are you really here to negotiate?

17
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:48,360
You're trying to swallow up
the entire Dongmen

18
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,560
in one bite.

19
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,479
Ms Xie,

20
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,600
in a place like Shencheng,

21
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,440
if you want to make money
and stay on your feet,

22
00:02:00,440 --> 00:02:01,900
you have to know the rules.

23
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,800
And my rule

24
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,180
is that I have the final say.

25
00:02:16,170 --> 00:02:17,680
You better think it through.

26
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,410
No matter how great Dongmen is,

27
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:21,000
without my approval,

28
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,850
it won't get off the ground.

29
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,320
Do you think

30
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:28,280
I need the empty promises you're selling?

31
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,079
So ungrateful.

32
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:36,560
Sister,

33
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,079
why waste words with her?

34
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:39,720
Okay.

35
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,000
I get it.

36
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,770
Let's talk another way.

37
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,320
This 500,000

38
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,600
is for one promise from you.

39
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,880
Ms Wan,

40
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,700
for the next 6 months,

41
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:54,900
none of your people
sets foot on my turf,

42
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:57,510
and you stay out of my business.

43
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,720
After 6 months,

44
00:02:59,079 --> 00:03:00,940
we settle things on our own terms.

45
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,320
You should've put it that way
from the start.

46
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,400
Why all this fancy talk about

47
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,800
"win-win" cooperation?

48
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,440
I'll take

49
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:10,400
the money.

50
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,640
I'll give you 6 months of peace—
for a price.

51
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:16,079
After 6 months,

52
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:18,370
we'll settle things properly.

53
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,079
It's a deal.

54
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,160
Okay.

55
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,000
Farewell.

56
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,360
Sister, how could you agree to that?

57
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:32,020
You're just giving her time
to get established.

58
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:34,160
What the hell do you know?

59
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,000
This is 500,000,

60
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,600
hard cash!

61
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:40,720
And who knows if she can even
get Dongcheng off the ground?

62
00:03:40,720 --> 00:03:41,680
Besides,

63
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,320
even if I give her 6 months,

64
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,810
what can a woman like her

65
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,150
really do?

66
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,200
No, Sister,

67
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:10,140
are we really going to let her build her business
undisturbed for 6 whole months?

68
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:12,840
Five hundred thousand is a lot, sure.

69
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,640
But have you thought about what happens

70
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:17,100
if she really gets Dongcheng
up and running?

71
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,620
Then that 500,000 won't mean a thing.

72
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,400
We'd have to answer to her

73
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,240
for the entire garment industry
in Shencheng.

74
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,400
Where would that leave us?

75
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,240
I've taken the money,

76
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,800
and I've given my word.

77
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,760
In our line of work,
you've got to keep your word.

78
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:35,090
So we're just going to
sit around and wait?

79
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,560
Shencheng is a big place,

80
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,400
and there are all kinds of people here.

81
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,400
What if something happens?

82
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,760
Or what if someone who's not with me

83
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,840
takes a dislike to her

84
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,520
and decides to cause trouble?

85
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,400
That's not something I can control.

86
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,400
How could I be responsible for something

87
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,730
I don't even know about,

88
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,440
right?

89
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,080
Sister.

90
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,400
I promise

91
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:00,840
no one will ever know.

92
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:03,200
I'll make her suffer in silence.

93
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,600
Rest assured.

94
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:10,000
You won't be dragged into this.
I guarantee it.

95
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,200
Xie Nanfeng

96
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,920
looks invulnerable.

97
00:05:16,080 --> 00:05:17,810
Do you think she has a weakness?

98
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Yes.

99
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,700
Of course she does.

100
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,600
Just wait

101
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:25,880
for the great show

102
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:29,070
I'll put on for you.

103
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,400
Who is it?

104
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:45,770
What's going on?

105
00:05:56,050 --> 00:05:56,710
I wanted to ask you something

106
00:05:56,710 --> 00:05:58,470
about Dongmen storefronts.

107
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:07,160
So that's what this is about.

108
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:12,600
Didn't you already make up your mind?

109
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,320
Why are you asking me now?

110
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,200
I used to

111
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,680
think I was on my own,

112
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,880
so I could make my own decisions.

113
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,400
But now

114
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,320
I've realized

115
00:06:31,840 --> 00:06:33,000
that what you think

116
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:35,200
matters to me, too.

117
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,600
Alright.

118
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:56,770
Tell me about it.

119
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,420
Let's see what we can come up with.

120
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,440
I want to give all the merchants
in Dongmen

121
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,500
a year of free rent.

122
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,400
Then go for it.

123
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,730
I knew you'd already made up your mind.

124
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,480
Whatever you decide,

125
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,000
I'll stand by you.

126
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:21,600
Now that we're done talking business,

127
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,400
can I have you all

128
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:25,400
to myself?

129
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,760
Well,

130
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:33,480
it depends on
how you plan to keep me around.

131
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:20,880
Ms. Xie,

132
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:24,690
[Stand Up for Your Legal Rights.
Reject Unfair Terms.]

133
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,120
one of the original villagers

134
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,520
has started causing trouble.

135
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:24,780
It seems to be yours...

136
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,360
Ms. Xie,

137
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,240
this...

138
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:29,320
Zhi, get out.

139
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:30,550
Ms. Xie.

140
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,640
Get out.

141
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:36,120
Stop!

142
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,080
One more step forward,

143
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,340
and we'll detonate it.

144
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:53,640
It really is you.

145
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,360
I don't have a single cent,

146
00:08:57,840 --> 00:09:00,240
but I do have a life.

147
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,840
Go ahead.

148
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,640
Blow it.

149
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,250
You guys couldn't come up with this trick.

150
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:08,800
Come out,

151
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:09,660
Chang Yongbin.

152
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,920
Don't, don't, don't!

153
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:12,960
You're really going to set it off?

154
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,040
We will die!

155
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,160
This has nothing to do with me!

156
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,840
It was all Ms Wan!

157
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,400
Anything else to say?

158
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,360
If you don't speak,

159
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,220
I'll blow it up.

160
00:09:21,470 --> 00:09:22,870
Honey, run!

161
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,880
Are you crazy?

162
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:30,440
Boss.

163
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:31,760
It's fake.

164
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,100
Take them and the evidence

165
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:39,760
to the police station!

166
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,040
Okay.

167
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:45,640
If something happened to you,

168
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:46,520
what would I do?

169
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:48,440
I...

170
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:51,660
I knew they wouldn't actually
risk their lives.

171
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,440
Yes.

172
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:54,160
You knew everything.

173
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:55,620
You had it all figured out.

174
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:58,060
But did you ever think about yourself

175
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,560
and me?

176
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,480
Chu Chunsheng!
